      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Majority of countries have a minimum age of 18 to be able to purchase alcohol and/or consume publicly. In the USA, this limit is 21 - but consumption is open to interpretation. Technically speaking, it is legal for a parent to give their under-21 offspring alcohol as long as it is consumed on their private property, and considering that's where most people are likely to be on VRChat, it's not really anyone's job to police this in VRChat. It varies country to country but it is safe to assume that any 18+ verified user is eligible to drink alcohol no matter where they are from.",
